description	"The Grand Inquisitor

The Leader Of The Inquistors, leveraging deep knowledge of Jedi combat forms to break down targets.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- Grand Inquisitor's Saber (Staff/All Single Styles)
-- Disarm Target On Hit
-- Saber Defense (3)
-- Blaster Defense (2)
-- Deflect (3)
-- Saber Throw (1)

^5Force Powers:
- Push (2)
- Pull (3)
- Grip (2)
- Lightning (1)
-- Cripples
-- 100% More Damage
- Sense (2)
- Jump (2)
- Mind Trick (1)

^8Attributes:
- Rally
- Stat Viewer
- Sense Immunity
- Force Block (2)
- Force Focus (2)
- Health Regen Capped at 35
- Anti Mindtrick (2)
- Tracking Beacon
- Slow Faller

^8Abilities:
- Briefing (Force/Block Dispenser 1) ^3[USE In Melee]"
